+## Key Capabilities
+
+- **Load PSD/PSB from file or stream.** It loads PSD and PSB files from file paths or streams using `Aspose.PSD.Image.Load` and `Aspose.PSD.ImageLoader.Load`, with `Aspose.PSD.StreamContainer` providing stream access via `StreamContainer.Stream`.
+- **Read document metadata.** It reads document metadata including Width, Height, `ChannelsCount`, `BitsPerChannel`, `ColorMode`, Version, Compression, and `ImageResources`, and exposes `Size` and Bounds via `Aspose.PSD.Rectangle` and `Aspose.PSD.Size`.
+- **Read and edit layer metadata.** It reads and edits layer metadata such as Name, Bounds, `BlendModeKey`, `IsVisible`, and Opacity, and updates layer geometry using coordinate properties like Left, Top, Right, and Bottom with `Aspose.PSD.RectangleF` and `Aspose.PSD.Point` support.
+- **Save without rendering.** It saves PSD and PSB files back to disk without rendering pixels, preserving the original structure and metadata, as demonstrated by `Image.Save` in the test suite at src/Aspose.PSD.FOSS.Test/.
+- **Build and test with .NET CLI.** It builds and tests using the .NET CLI with dotnet build Aspose.PSD-FOSS-for-.NET.sln and dotnet test Aspose.PSD-FOSS-for-.NET.sln, and installs via dotnet add package `Aspose.PSD.FOSS`.
+
+- make small safe edits to layer metadata;
